  "solution": {
    "text": "For option (A)<br/>$\\phi=\\mathrm{kt}+\\mathrm{C}$ it can be 1D motion<br/>$\\mathrm{eg} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{x}=\\mathrm{A} \\sin \\phi(\\mathrm{SHM})$<br/>For option (B)<br/>$\\mathrm{v}^2+\\mathrm{x}^2=$ constant yes 1D<br/>For option (C)<br/>time can't be negative Not possible<br/>For option (D)<br/>Possible<br/>A, B \\& D only",
